; The ONE variable: where a detached Control sits in the canvas draw order.
; `_enter_canvas` parents it at the viewport's own canvas and gives it a sort
; index from `gui_get_canvas_sort_index()` (canvas_item.cpp:234-285), so it is
; ordered against the OTHER canvas roots by the order it entered the tree —
; after the scene root's whole subtree — rather than at the slot its position in
; the file would give it. Red is authored FIRST and blue second, so a draw order
; taken from file position puts blue on top and one taken from canvas-root entry
; puts red on top. Every other detached-Control fixture keeps its box clear of
; the others, and cannot see this at all.

